Description: This package contains functions to work with a custom
    continuous distribution with density f(x) = 1 + sin(2*pi*x) on (0,1).
    It calculates probabilities, generates random numbers with the inverse
    transform method, compares theoretical and sample results, and checks
    the fit with a histogram and goodness-of-fit tests.
